<title>HONG KONG: ING Baring sets call warrants on Thailand 50 Index.</title>
<headline>ING Baring sets call warrants on Thailand 50 Index.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings Financial Products said it intended to issue 25 million American-style composite call warrants linked to the Stock Exchange of Thailand 50 Index.</p>
<p>One warrant represents one index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE  100 PCT OF CLOSING     PREMIUM	 13.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE   13.70 PCT OF CLOSING   GEARING	 6.73X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION    12.SEPT.97		 LISTING	 LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p>MIN EXER LOT  1,000 WARRANTS</p>
<p> NOTE	    GOVERNING LAW IS ENGLISH</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
